
Hole Calculation volume field = vgsd_volumecubicft
hole calculation lookup to hole detail = vgsd_holedetail
Hole detail lookup to work Order = vgsd_workorderid
Work Order Product table logical name = msdyn_workorder
Work Order Product total volume field = msdyn_quantity
Work Order Product lookup to Work Order = msdyn_workorder
Work Order Product lookup to Product = msdyn_product
Whether Hole Calculation has direct lookup to Work Order or only through Hole Detail







